self-test passed: 400 random boards against enumeration, and the bound of fact 7 on every board up to 4 by 4

Fact 6. Closed cells force other cells closed
   4 by 4 example, closed by hand: [(0, 2), (0, 3), (1, 2), (1, 3), (3, 0), (3, 1)]
   forced closed: (2, 0); rows [0, 1] can only use columns [0, 1], so none is left for row 2; certificate holds: True
   forced closed: (2, 1); rows [0, 1] can only use columns [0, 1], so none is left for row 2; certificate holds: True
   valid assignments before and after adding the forced cells: 4 and 4
   the same cell (2, 0) under row and column scaling, after 10, 100, 1000 and 10000 rounds: 0.049, 0.0051, 0.0005, 5e-05

